{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-03-10 16:15:00', 'title': "KROGER'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND", 'text': "CINCINNATI, MARCH 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO.'S (NYSE: KR) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 21 CENTS PER SHARE TO BE PAID ON JUNE 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 13, 2022. THE COMPANY'S QUARTERLY DIVIDEND HAS GROWN AT A DOUBLE-DIGIT COMPOUND ANNUAL GROWTH RATE SINCE IT WAS REINSTATED IN 2006."}